the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 3.

the actions are:
    the move left with *a thing* is made; known as left_1.
    the move left with *a husband* and *a second husband* is made; known as left_2.
    the move right with *a thing* is made; known as right_1.
    the move right with *a husband* and *a second husband* is made; known as right_2.

the fluents are:
    *a thing* is a boat; known as boat.
    *a thing* is a control; known as control.
    *a thing* is current; known as current.
    *a husband* is the location of *a thing*; known as location.
    the goal of *a role* is *a number*; known as goal.
    the move left with *a thing* is legal; known as legal_left_1.
    the move left with *a husband* and *a second husband* is legal; known as legal_left_2.
    the move right with *a thing* is legal; known as legal_right_1.
    the move right with *a husband* and *a second husband* is legal; known as legal_right_2.
    the game is terminal; known as terminal.

the templates are:
    *a husband* is individual.
    *a husband* is a husband.
    *a wife* is a wife.
    *a thing* is the spouse of *a wife*.
    the succ of *a thing* is *a second thing*.
    the scoremap of *a thing* is *a goal*.

the knowledge base jealousy includes:

the text of the game is at "sources/jealousy.hrf".

a husband is individual if
    the husband is a husband.

a husband is individual if
    the husband is a wife.

h1 is a husband.

h2 is a husband.

h3 is a husband.

w1 is a wife.

w2 is a wife.

w3 is a wife.

h1 is the spouse of w1.

h2 is the spouse of w2.

h3 is the spouse of w3.

the succ of 1 is 2.

the succ of 2 is 3.

the succ of 3 is 4.

the succ of 4 is 5.

the succ of 5 is 6.

the succ of 6 is 7.

the succ of 7 is 8.

the succ of 8 is 9.

the succ of 9 is 10.

the succ of 10 is 11.

the succ of 11 is 12.

the scoremap of 0 is 0.

the scoremap of 1 is 10.

the scoremap of 2 is 20.

the scoremap of 3 is 30.

the scoremap of 4 is 40.

the scoremap of 5 is 50.

the scoremap of 6 is 100.

the move left with a thing is legal at a time if
    right is a boat at the time
    and the thing is the location of right at the time.

the move right with a thing is legal at a time if
    left is a boat at the time
    and the thing is the location of left at the time.

the move left with a husband and a second husband is legal at a time if
    right is a boat at the time
    and the husband is the location of right at the time
    and the second husband is the location of right at the time
    and the husband is the spouse of the second husband.

the move left with a husband and a second husband is legal at a time if
    right is a boat at the time
    and the husband is the location of right at the time
    and the second husband is the location of right at the time
    and the husband is a husband
    and the second husband is a husband
    and the husband is different from the second husband.

the move left with a husband and a second husband is legal at a time if
    right is a boat at the time
    and the husband is the location of right at the time
    and the second husband is the location of right at the time
    and the husband is a wife
    and the second husband is a wife
    and the husband is different from the second husband.

the move right with a husband and a second husband is legal at a time if
    left is a boat at the time
    and the husband is the location of left at the time
    and the second husband is the location of left at the time
    and the husband is the spouse of the second husband.

the move right with a husband and a second husband is legal at a time if
    left is a boat at the time
    and the husband is the location of left at the time
    and the second husband is the location of left at the time
    and the husband is a husband
    and the second husband is a husband
    and the husband is different from the second husband.

the move right with a husband and a second husband is legal at a time if
    left is a boat at the time
    and the husband is the location of left at the time
    and the second husband is the location of left at the time
    and the husband is a wife
    and the second husband is a wife
    and the husband is different from the second husband.

the goal of robot is a number at a time if
    a thing is the count of each a husband such that
        the husband is the location of right at the time
    and the scoremap of the thing is the number.

the game is terminal at a time if
    a thing is the count of each a husband such that
        the husband is the location of right at the time
    and the thing is equal to 6.

the game is terminal at a time if
    a husband is a husband
    and the husband is the location of a thing at the time
    and a second husband is the location of the thing at the time
    and the second husband is a wife
    and a second thing is the spouse of the second husband
    and it is not the case that the second thing is the location of the thing at the time.

the game is terminal at a time if
    12 is current at the time.

when the move left with a thing is made
then left is a boat
    and the thing is the location of left
    and it is not the case that right is a boat
    and it is not the case that the thing is the location of right.

when the move left with a thing is made
    and a second thing is current
    and the succ of the second thing is a third thing
then the third thing is current
    and it is not the case that the second thing is current.

when the move left with a husband and a second husband is made
then left is a boat
    and the husband is the location of left
    and the second husband is the location of left
    and it is not the case that right is a boat
    and it is not the case that the husband is the location of right
    and it is not the case that the second husband is the location of right.

when the move left with a husband and a second husband is made
    and a thing is current
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is current
    and it is not the case that the thing is current.

when the move right with a thing is made
then right is a boat
    and the thing is the location of right
    and it is not the case that left is a boat
    and it is not the case that the thing is the location of left.

when the move right with a thing is made
    and a second thing is current
    and the succ of the second thing is a third thing
then the third thing is current
    and it is not the case that the second thing is current.

when the move right with a husband and a second husband is made
then right is a boat
    and the husband is the location of right
    and the second husband is the location of right
    and it is not the case that left is a boat
    and it is not the case that the husband is the location of left
    and it is not the case that the second husband is the location of left.

when the move right with a husband and a second husband is made
    and a thing is current
    and the succ of the thing is a second thing
then the second thing is current
    and it is not the case that the thing is current.

it must not be true that
    the move left with a thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move left with the thing is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move left with a husband and a second husband is made
    and it is not the case that the move left with the husband and the second husband is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move right with a thing is made
    and it is not the case that the move right with the thing is legal.

it must not be true that
    the move right with a husband and a second husband is made
    and it is not the case that the move right with the husband and the second husband is legal.

initially h1 is the location of left
    and h2 is the location of left
    and h3 is the location of left
    and w1 is the location of left
    and w2 is the location of left
    and w3 is the location of left
    and left is a boat
    and 1 is current
    and robot is a control.

% EpilogJS's state after the play (the twin's final state under LPS2 must be the same):
%   - boat(right)
%   - control(robot)
%   - current(2)
%   - location(h1,right)
%   - location(h2,left)
%   - location(h3,left)
%   - location(w1,left)
%   - location(w2,left)
%   - location(w3,left)
scenario play is:
    the move right with h1 is made from 1 to 2.

